            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Shruti 1.4.37

- Clicking "Update available" now brings the Install / Later window straight to the front. Before, it could open hidden behind the Shruti panel and pop up later, as if by itself.
- Shruti still never interrupts you with an update window: a new version shows only as the orange strip at the top of the panel and a dot on the menu-bar icon, until you click one of them.

Requires macOS 14.2 or later; Apple silicon and Intel. Existing settings, app arrangements and window preferences are retained.
]]></description>
